  "notes": [
    "All p73–82 originals and p83 boundary were visually checked; p73 Unit08/Level3, p83 Unit09/Level3. No blank content page in this range.",
    "36 numbered + 9 independently headed unnumbered occurrences = 45. suspect occurs twice in distinct printed blocks, vt. and n./adj.; preserve two stable items and their book meanings while sharing the existing ID.",
    "The old MD has only 28 headings and omits many actual numbered heads, including fairly, substance, pour, pad, cinema, clay, fence, garage, fuel, decorate, decrease, emotional, lick, nest and element. It cannot be used as a complete inventory.",
    "cow, advertising, suspicious, comfortable, abreast, awareness, conscience, fair/fairy, substantial, promotion, movie theater, biofuel, decoration, increase and elemental/elementary are inline supplements; do not promote them into independent heads.",
    "domestic is on p74; shade on p75. conscience is explicitly under 衍 in the book; retain the printed label without creating a semantic or morphological rule.",
    "Starred blackout, pajamas, indigenous, pledge, inconspicuous, a pep talk, morale, odorless, toxic, jug and explicit may as well + V are retained; full running examples and prayer/proverb sentences are not adopted.",
    "Only existing exact headwords or explicitly stored wordVariants are mapped; actual officialWord is preserved. No fuzzy or lemma mapping, new formal ID, sense ID, relation rule or master row."
  ]
}
